            "body": "> @echasnovski\r\n> \r\n> I bumped into this just now. May be it is worth mentioning in the doc about missing feature in stable version.\r\n\r\nIt is not a missing, but a breaking feature, which is [mentioned in CHANGELOG](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#mini.indentscope). By default on GithlHub you see README for `main` branch describing its features. Switch to `stable` branch which [has an appropriate description](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/stable/readmes/mini-indentscope.md#default-config).\r\n\r\nIf you are on a `stable` branch, I would suggest favoring reading documentation locally from your installed version.",
